  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Title: Core funding of the organisation&#x2019;s only programme &#x201c;Joining hands for Gender and Climate Justice&#x201d;. Project Objective: The overall goal of the programme is to empower communities to drive gender justice and respond to inequalities through collaborative actions sustainably. In collaboration with internationally recognised research institutions such as Columbia University and London School of Hygiene and Tropical Medicine, UZIKWASA will continue to generate evidence on what works to address GBV and gender inequalities in Pangani district and to scale up a tested reflective learning approach.</narrative>
  </description>
